WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.650
Disgusting.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.500
<i>The food here is as vile as ever.</i>

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.710
They could at least serve some meat.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:19.580
And jambon persillé, sautéed perch, 
fricasseed free-range chicken,

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.290
and, of course, pear compote for dessert.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.330
You never stop complaining, do you?

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.380
I thought you'd sworn off 
eating food from this world.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.270
<b>Grumble</b>

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.880
Regardless, this is just awful.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.170
I miss Baphomet's exquisite cooking.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.240
<b>Grumble</b>

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:34.190
Then go back to Hell.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.240
<b>Grumble</b>

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.140
And never come back.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.350
I wouldn't mind some good food 
every now and then either...

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.240
<b>Grumble</b>

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.020
Oh yeah, tomorrow's the culture festival!

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.020
That's right...

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.060
Culture festival?

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.120
"Notice of the Culture Festival.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.240
The annual culture festival will be 
held on campus again this year.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:31.130
All are free to set up booths to sell 
food, drinks, sundries, and the like."

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:35.220
So, what exactly does a culture festival entail?

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.510
Hey!

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:37.770
Morning, all.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.250
Good morning!

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:43.090
Did everyone receive their 
brooches for the festival?

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:44.800
Oh, yes.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.640
Head Boy, will you be doing anything there?

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.830
Yes. Come and have a look if you'd like.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:51.860
Bye.

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:54.720
Oh, yes...

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.440
Participating in the festival 
counts as part of your grade.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.240
Do your best with that in mind.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.960
All right! A chance to turn my grades around!

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:08.250
Are your grades even in a position where
an event like this can turn them around?

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.670
Don't say that...

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:16.250
<i>Of course! I can use this to boost my 
grades and raise money for my tuition!</i>

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.630
<i>A chance to kill two birds with one stone!</i>

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.220
William, you're giving off that black aura again...

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.470
Hey, maybe there are some 
booths already up and running!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.650
Let's go see!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:37.420
What is all this?

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.530
The culture festival.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:43.800
If you set up a booth, you can 
keep whatever money you earn.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.380
And if the student customers like it,

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.530
they can give you their brooches.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.250
Whoever has the most brooches 
at the end of the day wins.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.670
Eager

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.390
I see, that sounds pretty fun!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:57.710
Oh...

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.550
The food looks good!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.510
This is the one day we're 
free to eat whatever we want!

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.760
What're you gonna do, William?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.700
Nothing.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.230
By which I mean I won't subject 
myself to any menial labor.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.870
I'm an intellectual, after all!

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:16.930
Oh, I see.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.200
So what specifically are you going to do?

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.650
<b>Has no idea</b>

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.660
What kind of booth is that?

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.590
When did he do all this?

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.080
Sytry's pretty cute.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:35.320
His fan club has over 200 members.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.230
This is an all-boys school...

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.540
Step right up!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.650
For a limited time, buy ten photos

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.940
and receive a coupon good for one handshake!

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:49.370
Or buy the fifty-photo set and get
your photo taken with Sytry himself!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.040
I'll take fifty!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.340
I'll take a hundred!

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:53.180
Of course!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.980
Everyone line up!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.690
Gilles, what do you think you're...

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.190
No, even worse, Sytry...

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:06.930
He's made some fine bait out of you.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:11.530
Don't be shy. Come close.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:13.370
P-Pardon me...

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.500
Okay, here we go!

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:24.970
Shall I do your hair, makeup, and 
costume as well, Your Excellency?

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:28.430
I need no help from the likes of you!

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.590
Don't try to stop me, William!

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:37.930
Oh, right, I need to get my own 
booth ready. See you later!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.630
That does it!

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:44.900
I, the Eminent Grand Duke 
Dantalion, must take action!

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.950
That does nothing!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.490
Please finish up your work in 
Hell before you run off to play!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.470
The paperwork sitting on your 
desk is up to the ceiling!

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:54.660
You vermin...

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.160
I am your master!

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:03.520
Just watch! I'll open a shop 
that'll be far hotter than Sytry's!

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.970
I'll take on all comers!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:14.100
Dantalion, Dantalion!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.630
Dantalion, Dantalion!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.660
I'm surrounded by morons.

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:20.190
Dantalion, Dantalion!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.190
Step right up!

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:23.420
Ceylon, Indian, Chinese, Japanese!

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.150
I've got the finest herbal teas 
from all over the world!

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.340
This one will turn up your sex appeal!

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.780
Guaranteed fast-acting!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.470
I'll take one of those!

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:34.340
Do you have one that boosts brain power?

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:36.110
One fat-burner!

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:39.780
Brother, word has it this 
booth has the best tea.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:42.840
Oh? If they have any from Egypt, 
I'd like to try some.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.640
O-Oh no...

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.750
I've gotta do something, too!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.760
Okay, everyone, please form a line.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.640
The problem is, what on earth can I do?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.880
<i>Sytry's fleecing his fan club with 
his flair for cross-dressing.</i>

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:02.670
<i>Dantalion's cornered the 
meathead demographic.</i>

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.650
<i>Even Isaac's raking it in with his tea,</i>

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.860
<i>and he's in the lower fifth year!</i>

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:11.190
<i>It's meaningless to try to best 
them by doing the same thing.</i>

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.120
<i>I know!</i>

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.430
Okay, line up and proceed in order.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:20.620
H-Hey, Sytry.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:23.580
Th-This is a lovely booth you have here.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:29.010
Here to get yourself a fifty-photo set and
a commemorative picture with yours truly?

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.300
<i>Not in a million years.</i>

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.810
Actually, that aside,

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.640
it looks like Dantalion's booth 
is also doing quite well.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.510
All the jocks are swarming the place.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:46.310
He may have even had about 
as many customers as you.

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:51.580
My beauty could never be 
outdone by the likes of him!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.030
Oh, of course.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.810
I totally agree.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:58.300
I don't think he can beat you.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:01.750
Still...

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.560
Still...?

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:06.920
Still, you need a clincher!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:10.020
A clincher? What do you mean?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.090
Sytry...

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.690
You need me!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:18.720
Only I can bring forth your true glory!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.880
You have unlimited, untapped potential.

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:27.110
You can do far better than a puny booth like this.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:31.820
I can help you use your strengths 
to their fullest extent.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:36.240
Now, do you want to widen the 
gap between you and Dantalion?

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.500
Gotcha.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:44.960
To the Olympics! Go for the gold!

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.590
Dantalion, got a minute?

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:51.760
Sure...

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:54.550
What is it, William?

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.890
Looks like your booth is doing well.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:02.440
Yes, everyone's completely 
enamored with my machismo!

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.010
<i>Fool.</i>

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:11.280
I must admit, you've changed 
my opinion of you a little.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.230
Your strength, your physique...

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:18.790
And more than anything, 
Dantalion, your sharp wit.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.690
Every now and then, 
I catch myself admiring you.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:27.830
Honestly, I'm not sure why I hadn't 
noticed your charisma until today.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.810
William...

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.310
I have a request, Dantalion.

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.010
Lend me that power.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:39.510
No, that charisma.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.440
Gotcha. One more down.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.440
Hey, Isaac!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.350
How's business?

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:57.880
I'm getting lots of customers.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:01.270
Look, I'm making a fortune!

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.700
And check out all these brooches!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.730
<i>He got all those?!</i>

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:06.160
<i>But he's Isaac!</i>

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.550
Well, I have a proposition for you.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:11.300
Give me all the tea in your store.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:16.470
Seriously, shut up and transfer 
all your tea-related skills to me.

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.010
Wh-What?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.930
I don't expect it for free, of course.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:25.670
From tomorrow until the 
next test, after school,

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.950
for a full six hours, three times a week,

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:31.020
your prefect and head of 
the class, Professor William,

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:35.570
will tutor you in such a way that 
even a monkey could understand.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.530
I guarantee you will 
graduate to the next grade!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:41.490
What do you say? That's a fantastic deal.

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:44.890
I-I'm a bit scared, but I do want to advance...

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.540
Gotcha. One more down...

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.520
Again.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.960
Excuse me, one aphrodisiac tea, please!

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:58.470
Thank you very much!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.720
I'd like mandrake longevity tea.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.090
Coming up.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.390
<i>I'll use any pawn I can, even demons!</i>

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.840
<i>Behold, I'm rolling in dough 
and I didn't lift a finger!</i>

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.470
<i>I've a superior grasp of economics,</i>

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:14.690
<i>and I'm so versed in the human 
psyche, I can manipulate demons.</i>

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.980
<i>I'll be Prime Minister before I know it!</i>

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.490
William!

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.280
What? Get back to work.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.950
This isn't what we discussed at all!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.040
Yeah!

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.260
What are you talking about?

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:31.460
We're only making all this profit because I'm
using you two to your maximum potential.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.330
I only proposed that you work with me.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:37.940
You two are the ones who agreed.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:45.630
Why must a noble demon like me work 
alongside this oaf of a Nephilim?

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:47.610
Now you've done it.

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:49.730
It's all true, isn't it?

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:54.230
Boy, the future interim Emperor 
of Hell sure is a hard worker!

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:57.280
Master Sytry, may I place my order?

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.610
Yes!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:02.450
Excuse me, Dantalion, I'm ready to order, too.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:04.410
I'm on it!

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.020
<i>I feel like I've seen those two before...</i>

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.410
William, come here a sec!

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:14.670
Welcome to the—

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:17.550
Um, we'd like...

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.050
...herbal teas as well.

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:22.020
C-Coming right up.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.020
Well done neglecting your duties in Hell...

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.140
...to work as a butler up here, Your Excellency.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:30.560
W-William ordered me to...

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.370
Dantalion, one protein tea, please!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.480
Make mine a double!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.930
Dantalion, Dantalion!

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:39.920
A butler cosplay tea house.

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:41.990
Dantalion, Dantalion!

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.990
Mister Dantalion.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.350
Tee-hee.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.950
J-Just a moment, please.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.880
Two herbal teas for those two.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:53.590
Excuse me?! I've got my hands 
full here! Serve them yourself!

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.960
Do you realize who you're talking to?!

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.930
Shut up and get to work!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.380
This looks good.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.720
Oh, you've got a good eye, sir!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.340
That one's got all the fat 
in just the right places.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.770
I'll take all the ones you've got hanging there.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.830
And that and those.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.540
Yes, sir!

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.820
Hold it!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:20.540
I'll take all that meat you have.

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:23.090
Leonard.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.290
Well, well.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:28.570
If it isn't the lowly Nephilim's 
dirty mountain goat butler.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.400
<i>Let me explain.</i>

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:32.820
<i>This nice guy here is actually me,</i>

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:35.290
<i>your old friend, the black goat Baphomet.</i>

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:39.520
<i>And this arrogant jerk, 
making his first appearance,</i>

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:43.170
<i>is Viscount Sytry's ram butler, Leonard.</i>

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.140
It's been some time, Leonard.

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:50.220
You're dressed even more oddly than usual.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:56.560
I've been in China until just the other day, 
expanding my culinary prowess!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.980
Meanwhile, you only ever 
cook the same old things.

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:03.750
I'm on a much higher level now, much higher.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.320
I see. Well, I'll be going.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.740
Hold it right there!

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.700
What now?

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.150
Now that I've finally found you again,

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:17.160
let's settle once and for
all who's the better chef!

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:18.950
Oh?

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.540
I thought you'd never ask.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:27.050
So, are you buying anything or not?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.330
Elector!

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:31.810
Elector!

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:33.100
Elector!

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.060
Shut up!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.680
I will sue you both for obstruction of business!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:39.000
Master William, given your status as the Elector,

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.900
we would love to have you judge our contest.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.560
I'm afraid I'm too busy.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.380
Also, who are you people?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.540
Baphomet, it's you!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.700
Huh? You know him?

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.870
He's blocking the entrance! 
Tell him to leave right—

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.110
Wait, did you say Baphomet?

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:55.010
As in the goat?

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:55.620
Yes.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.330
Your Excellency, it's one 
of those things, you see.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:02.210
Yes, I understand.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:03.810
William.

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:06.430
Baphomet and Leonard are going 
to have a cooking competition,

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.710
and they want you to judge.

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.630
What? And why should I bother?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.260
Because it'll be a chance to 
eat some of Baphomet's cooking.

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:20.230
My Leonard is a top-class chef, as well.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.230
Master Sytry!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:25.750
Very well.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.990
I'll make an exception and help you out.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:33.160
The rules: each chef has one hour to
make as many dishes as they like.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.910
Whoever scores the most points will 
be crowned Cooking King of Hell!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.170
Very well.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.410
Let's do it!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:01.060
Ladies and gentlemen,
the time is finally at hand.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:05.310
Today's battle will decide once 
and for all who is worthy...

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.030
to claim the title of top chef!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.310
Let's begin!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:16.980
In the red corner, the ebony 
handyman, the black goat Baphomet!

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:21.820
In the blue corner, a funky guy 
just returning from China,

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:25.000
the ram butler Leonard!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.430
And here are your judges!

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:30.230
I've been wanting some food 
that actually tastes good.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:33.010
Wow, food from Hell! I can't wait!

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:40.340
<i>No one in this school can resist 
the allure of delicious cuisine.</i>

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:42.860
<i>Which means all eyes will be on this contest!</i>

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:45.170
<i>The top spot is as good as mine!</i>

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.190
<i>Excellent grades and extra money!</i>

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:52.150
<b>he 
he 
he</b>

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:50.040
<i>I amaze myself.</i>

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:55.010
Chefs, ready...

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:57.770
Begin!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:07.710
Behold my ultimate move,

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.730
the Multiple Flambé Frenzy!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.400
Look at Leonard!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:15.820
It's clear that he's trained hard 
in preparation for this battle!

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.770
Just look at those woks fly!

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:20.890
Let's check in on Baphomet!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.520
Cooking isn't about performance.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:26.350
Baphomet's not slacking in the slightest!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.560
He moves too fast for the eye to follow!

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:37.570
And in a brilliant ironic twist, 
the main dish is lamb stew!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.100
Time's up!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:07.440
And now the moment we've all been 
waiting for, the taste test!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.550
Gilly's going to have a bite, too.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:16.450
Flavors as subtle and 
delicate as a spider's web,

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.870
woven together in a perfect tapestry!

00:18:21.590 --> 00:18:25.440
A hundred-years' war of flavor!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.340
It's so good!

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.610
This goes beyond what you'd call "food."

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:36.520
What can I call it?

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:41.760
It's... an everlasting flavor bonanza!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.610
Is there some kind of law in Hell

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:46.600
that mandates these reactions 
when you eat food from there?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.990
What exactly do you think Hell is?

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:00.150
It's...

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:01.700
It's so...

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:05.210
I didn't know food this good could exist...

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:11.710
No, even in Hell, it's not easy to 
come by a meal of this caliber...

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.250
What can I say?

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:17.210
I think you know, William.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.210
Yes.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:22.450
Yum!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.440
And now, the judges must pick a winner.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:32.900
Today, once and for all, 
the true top chef will be crowned!

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:36.150
But who will it be?

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.840
Judges, your verdicts!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:48.750
Amazing!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.080
Master Sytry!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:54.370
In a stunning upset, he has awarded 10 points

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:58.460
to Dantalion's butler Baphomet, 
and none to his own butler Leonard!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:02.590
By a final score of 50 to 40, 
the true king of cuisine is...

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.930
Baphomet!

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.520
It was the sweets...

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:10.560
Leonard...

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.190
Why?!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.660
Why must you always demand them?

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:17.960
Bake me cookies, bake me a cake,

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:21.720
cream cheese angel cake, absinthe pear jelly,

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:25.070
huge custard puddings, 
chocolate fondant...

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:30.890
I went all the way to China 
to learn to cook Chinese food!

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:33.710
How could you choose him over me?!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.340
Leonard... why?

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.600
Why'd you go to China?

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.380
You should've trained in France.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.390
I won't forget this!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:47.720
What's the meaning of this?!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.690
Gourmet food...

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.640
from around the world?

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.520
We'll need you to pay the bills for that show.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:00.510
New order's up, and step on it.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.950
Why have I been reduced to this?

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.230
Now that we're clear, get to work.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:13.320
This is how an intellectual competes.

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:18.350
Unbelievable...

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:22.800
It's time to announce the results 
from our culture festival!

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:27.680
<i>I took over Dantalion's, Sytry's, 
and Isaac's businesses,</i>

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.450
<i>and even capitalized on the two butlers' cooking.</i>

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:32.270
<i>First place is mine.</i>

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:33.980
First place goes to...

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.520
Nathan Caxton!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.320
The Head Boy really was incredible!

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:41.530
It really was on a different level.

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:43.400
Really? It was that great?

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:45.930
What? You didn't even go?

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:46.990
You missed out!

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:50.220
British culture is quite complex.

00:21:50.220 --> 00:21:52.950
Indeed. I didn't expect him to go so far...

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:56.540
What in the world did he do?!

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:00.750
I guess I got a bit too into this.

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.130
All right...

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:09.510
Time to get serious.

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:42.790
The wonderful thing about Shakespeare

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:45.520
is how vividly he describes 
the ugliness, viciousness,

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.110
and foolishness of humans.

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:49.860
How pitiful that he had to be a human himself.

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.320
Welcome home, my master.

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:54.250
Please, this way.
